<title>CHILE: Sergio Henriquez named Chile housing minister.</title>
<headline>Sergio Henriquez named Chile housing minister.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sergio Henriquez was sworn in Thursday as Chile's new housing minister to replace Edmundo Hermosilla, who resigned Tuesday after admitting receiving a gift from a businessman involved in a public housing scandal.</p>
<p>Henriquez served previously as general manager of state water company Esval.</p>
<p>((-- Margaret Orgill, Santiago newsroom, 562-699-5595 x212))</p>
